01:13:39,136 --> 01:13:41,198
If you can, go without socks as well.

777
01:13:41,299 --> 01:13:50,449
So first, I'm just gonna make sure that I got that good arch in my foot, so I'm on my three points of contact, ball of the foot, ball of the pinky foot, and heel.

