01:13:51,511 --> 01:13:57,277
From here, I'm gonna raise my big toe as high as I can, and I'm gonna get my other four toes down.

779
01:13:57,658 --> 01:14:03,745
So I'm gonna hold for three seconds, and I'm pushing these other four toes as hard as I can into the ground.

780
01:14:03,725 --> 01:14:07,171
So one, two, three, and then I'm gonna switch.

781
01:14:07,291 --> 01:14:15,905
Now I'm gonna push my big toe down, and I'm gonna raise my other four toes as high as I can, and I'm pushing my big toe down as hard as I can right now.

782
01:14:16,125 --> 01:14:18,629
One, two, three, switch.

783
01:14:18,649 --> 01:14:20,873
One, two, three, switch.

784
01:14:21,511 --> 01:14:23,997
Okay, so this is working on those intrinsic muscles of the feet.

785
01:14:24,358 --> 01:14:33,439
