793
01:14:57,970 --> 01:14:58,270
Okay.

794
01:14:58,290 --> 01:15:04,798
And then after three seconds, I'm going to hold or push my big toes down and I'm going to lift my other four toes.

795
01:15:05,572 --> 01:15:11,559
All right, so this is gonna kind of neurologically train you to move your toes independently without each other.

796
01:15:11,920 --> 01:15:17,706
And then after a couple weeks, you should be able to take away the manual pressure and just do it normal.

797
01:15:18,227 --> 01:15:24,254
Okay, this is gonna have a huge impact on your overall athleticism and your injury prevention long-term.

798
01:15:24,574 --> 01:15:27,858
So this drill seems like it's kind of weird, kind of easy.

799
01:15:27,878 --> 01:15:29,240
