01:16:06,119 --> 01:16:33,105
we get it up nice and high we're not going to shortchange it down here so get it high knee is straight already i should feel a stretch in my hip kind of through the it band area now from here i'm turning up the other way and i'm just going to cycle through this we should feel a little bit of a burn in the core but it's more so full body mobility so we're going to get a lot of mobility through the hips and through the spine and we're going to get that uh that core activation as well

