01:19:01,850 --> 01:19:03,211
We're going to go for 30 seconds.

841
01:19:03,371 --> 01:19:07,735
For the over-under hamstring stretch, I'm just going to go over with the left leg.

842
01:19:08,056 --> 01:19:09,857
I'm going to come down, touch the toe.

843
01:19:09,938 --> 01:19:19,527
Now, if you can't touch the toe without rounding the back, then just go mid-shin or even to the knees, just as low as we can, but we don't want to go to the point where we have to round our back.

844
01:19:19,507 --> 01:19:27,188
Okay, so I'm gonna get down, touch my toes, back to neutral, and then I cross over the other way, and I'm going the other side.

845
01:19:30,880 --> 01:19:35,247
All right, we're gonna go five over and back, so it's 10 total touches.

846
01:19:35,447 --> 01:19:40,795
For the quad hamstring leans, I'm just gonna go into a quad stretch, so I'm gonna pull my right foot up.

