01:20:32,057 --> 01:20:32,639
That's okay.

859
01:20:32,980 --> 01:20:34,584
Let's just get as low as we can there.

860
01:20:35,045 --> 01:20:35,987
One, two, three.

861
01:20:35,967 --> 01:20:37,710
three and back up.

