01:22:17,763 --> 01:22:19,947
Drive the knees out with the elbows.

887
01:22:20,027 --> 01:22:20,367
Hold.

888
01:22:20,968 --> 01:22:22,030
One, two, three.

889
01:22:22,010 --> 01:22:22,711
Three.

890
01:22:23,052 --> 01:22:23,773
Rock it back.

891
01:22:24,134 --> 01:22:25,937
Heels back down to the ground.

892
01:22:26,198 --> 01:22:27,841
One, two, three.

893
01:22:27,901 --> 01:22:29,123
I need one hand up.

