in a back squat now of course you got to be pretty advanced for stuff like this if you're new to weight training you're probably not going to want to load up on this exercise and you should probably still be doing basic things like goblet squats but as long as you're advanced and you've been lifting a while then we can start light and gradually load up as always we should really feel quad and glute working but we're not feeling any pain in the knee in the low back in any joints or any tendons now if you don't have the smith machine

