we're going to use a barbell but I don't like barbell rear foot elevated because I don't like the danger of having a heavy weight and then balancing on one leg so I'm gonna come in pretend like I actually have some weight on this bar and I'm gonna do a half reverse lunge so I'm putting this foot back alright that's for my added stability and I'm just coming down to a 90 degree angle and then I'm stepping right back up alright so I'm here

