right above the toe now this exercise you really got to start light and feel it out once your form is perfect then we start to load up and then our final option if you're not comfortable with the barbell option or the smith machine option hold dumbbells start light gradually go up eventually we want to get pretty heavy and on this one i could either do my half reverse lunge or i can do my rear foot elevated so i can put that back foot up and go down to my 90 degree angle

