here so this is my base position and what you're going to notice is we're really loading that hip this is one of my favorite ways to teach people how to get more hip activation and glute activation and load through the hip with that first step explosiveness all right so we're not relying on those quads to push us forward after this drill you're going to learn how to really get into the glute and so i need you to bring that left shoulder down

