push out now you'll notice on this foot my toe is gonna point in and my heel is gonna point away slightly I don't want you to think about this consciously to where you're really hitting a hard pivot you should do this naturally where we step into it and the toe is pointed in the direction that I'm going and the heel is pointed away some of you guys naturally will come here and we don't want this to move forward alright so I'm loaded up load that glute and

