04:40:34,234 --> 04:40:35,817
So what I'm gonna do

3011
04:40:35,797 --> 04:40:44,559
is I'm just gonna start on the ground, regular squat position, feet a little wider than shoulder width apart, and I'm going straight up with the plate.

