For our AI walks we're getting nice and shifty so all it is an AI cross is a loose cross where basically he gets thin so feet are narrow and then he takes a wide step out notice this knee drops in to sell that movement and he shifts his body weight so it's not here like a lot of you guys do or in football where your torso stays here you got to shift that torso over this knee so I'm really shifting my weight this direction

