boom so your cell leg becomes your stride leg not how most of you guys do it where this is your cell leg and then this is your stride leg that's not how we get out of a cut so all we're doing is accumulating reps with that ai cross we're gonna get nice and rhythmic with it so we're just going side to side i don't need you sprinting out we're just working on that shiftiness aspect so all it is long step shift the torso here recover one two

