04:44:26,815 --> 04:44:54,679
to push and sell in this direction and then i cross now this is going to be my strike foot so i'm here strike push and then recover strike push recover strike push recover all right that's all it is that's an ai hanging cross funny thing is it's the same footwork for a lot of sports anybody who has to shift somebody else is going to end up using this same footwork at one time or another

