07:11:38,397 --> 07:12:01,823
push out laterally and then as soon as this foot lands you got to transition quick as you can like it's hot lava get back over that cone add a little rotation to it and then I'm stepping in left right so then it's a left right regular takeoff over that hurdle now I'm gonna land on this other side now I got to go rotationally so I got to go here boom

4640
07:12:01,803 --> 07:12:22,191
boom okay so I'm always open to this side so I land here I get here push now it's right left get over okay now of course I land here boom open this way so now it's right left right all right this is kind of confusing to start

