14:41:40,179 --> 14:41:43,444
I like to use two thin bands and tie them together.

9765
14:41:43,825 --> 14:41:47,992
Just make sure you don't have the super thick bands like this because that's going to be too much tension.

9766
14:41:48,392 --> 14:41:51,377
If you don't have the bands, then let's just do this without the resistance.

9767
14:41:51,417 --> 14:41:51,918
That's fine.

9768
14:41:53,180 --> 14:41:54,803
So I'm going to step in.

9769
14:41:55,998 --> 14:42:21,786
i'm going to start at the point where i just have a little bit of tension notice that it's pulling directly behind so i want to even with about hip height now from here you could either have a line or i'm just using an imaginary line and i'm going on one foot and i'm going as quick as i possibly can over and back all the way out until i can't go any further and then i'm going to bring it back so on the way back we're actually getting a little more deceleration so

9770
14:42:21,766 --> 14:42:38,982
it's here quick as we can over and back over and back staying on the ball of the foot now i have maximal tension and now i bring it back now it's pulling me so the tendencies to make big jumps you got to keep them small and precise so it's here

