from the hips keeping my back nice and straight if you want to reach down and touch your ankle or touch your toe you can but don't reach down and start to bend over from the back so i like to just keep my hands here to make sure that i'm not rounding the upper back

9807
14:46:52,542 --> 14:46:56,411
and I'm just gonna hold 15 seconds, and then I'm gonna switch over to the other side.

