or we could go vertical here and then we could lean over and get the glute horizontally as well so the next one we're going to move down the posterior chain we're going to focus on the hamstrings so i'm just going to sit on the roller and i'm going to cross over this foot and i'm just going to roll from the bottom of my glute all the way to the top of my knee so i'm just going to start in the center and then i'm gradually going to rock over a little bit so i can get the outside of my hamstrings

